  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Remote Adjudication Interview Support to Family Class Applicants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, IOM supports the Government of Canada in organizing remote interviews in Sudan for applicants for permanent residence in Canada as members of the Family Class or Family Members of In-Canada Refugees. This includes, among others, inviting the interviewees, providing technical equipment and support to ensure online interviews are possible, ensuring child care for the interviewees&apos; children and providing support to copy, print and share documentation.</narrative>
  </description>
